{'symbol': 'HSIC', 'date': '2023-04-10 06:30:00', 'title': 'HENRY SCHEIN MEDICAL ANNOUNCES WINNER OF ITS 2023 RISING STAR AWARD PROGRAM', 'text': 'MELVILLE, N.Y.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HENRY SCHEIN MEDICAL, THE U.S. MEDICAL BUSINESS OF HENRY SCHEIN, INC. (NASDAQ: HSIC), ANNOUNCED GINA HARRIS, HEAD ATHLETIC TRAINER AT BELLPORT HIGH SCHOOL IN BROOKHAVEN, NEW YORK, AS THE WINNER OF THE THIRD ANNUAL HENRY SCHEIN MEDICAL ATHLETICS AND SCHOOLS RISING STAR AWARD. THE AWARD CELEBRATES EMERGING ATHLETIC TRAINERS WITH ONE TO FIVE YEARS OF EXPERIENCE IN THE SPORTS MEDICINE INDUSTRY.'}